## Scanning Issues (go flag)

This scan happens inside `/work` (Phase 5). The rules below describe the mechanic.

**Quick check:** Read first 2 characters of each issue file.
- Starts with `go` → Agent's turn, process this issue
- Anything else → Skip, not agent's turn

**Rules:**
- Case-insensitive (`go`, `Go`, `GO` all work)
- Agent removes `go` line when done (waiting for user)
- User adds `go` line back when ready for agent action
- If user adds comments after `go` line, copy them to Discussion as `[user]` entry before processing

